# Approval is a person. In a team, the pull request that carries a promotion -- the moved
# files and the approval record `easkills promote` writes -- is the signature, and these
# owners are who must sign it. Replace the team below with your architecture board, then
# turn on "Require review from Code Owners" in the branch protection rule for main.
/model/approved/            @your-org/architecture-board
/governance-log/approvals/  @your-org/architecture-board
/standards/                 @your-org/architecture-board
